'''VirtuaI''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Futuristic Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.

== Appearance ==
Virtual is a black saber with streaks of blue all around it, in a futuristic style, hence the name. Its handle is black as well, with vibrant blue line and dashes. This knife has no guard.

== Trivia ==
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/130167063/Virtual-BLOXcon-Power-Sword Virtual BLOXcon Power Sword], the sword that came with the [https://www.roblox.com/bundles/207/Virtual-BLOXcon-Power-Armor Virtual BLOXcon Power Armour] package. This could have been obtained through spending $20 in the ROBLOX Shop - shop.roblox.com - during Virtual BLOXcon 2013, but it's recolored with blue borders and stripes.
* Upon purchasing the [[Futuristic Item Pack]], players would receive this knife, the godly gun [[Blaster]] and the godly pet [[Electro]].
*It is part of a set with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Blaster]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Virtual_Set Virtual Set], and with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet [[Electro]], making the Full Virtual Set.
*When salvaged, it provides 48 godly [[Shards|shards]].

